When you make your pustules explode you leave a pool of defiled blood on the ground for 5 turns.

Foes caught inside get assaulted by black tentacles every turn, dealing 10% darkness tentacle damage and covering them in your black blood for 2 turns.

Creatures that hit you while covered in your blood heal you for [17%, 23%, 27%, 31%, 35% (TL1-5; SP 100)] of the damage done.

The healing received increases with your Spellpower.
